ate":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":346,"closed_issues":2304,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:34:58Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-09-03T05:46:52Z","updated_at":"2026-09-13T16:14:41Z","closed_at":"2026-09-13T16:14:32Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.7.2.stable.official [ed1daf0bf]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.2.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.16.1047) - AMD Ryzen 5 5600X 6-Core Processor (12 threads) - 31.92 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using a font variation resource as the project's custom font under  **Project > GUI > Theme > Custom Font**, the variation values will reset when adding new scripts to the project. Pretty bizarre bug\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/35e6ec2b-f798-48a9-b633-c412e905a0fa\n\nRemoving the script and reloading the editor restores the custom variation values.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThis happens in a brand new project but these steps are based on the font file I used in the reproduction project.\n\n1. Right click in the file system tab and click \"New Resource\"\n2. Select **FontVariation** and save it as `montserrat_medium.tres` (you can name it whatever).\n3. With the new variation selected, change the following:\n    - Set the base font to `montserrat_variable_weight.ttf`.\n    - Under Variation, click Variation Coordinates and change the weight to 600.\n4. Save.\n5. Go to **Project > GUI > Theme > Custom Font** and select the font variation you just created.\n6. At the bottom, click **Save and Restart**.\n7. Upon restart, the weight should still not have changed however creating any new scripts will trigger the variation's weight to reset.\n9. Right click the file system tab and create and save a new script with any name.\n10. Inspect the font variation resource and you should see the weight has been reset back to 100.\n11. This will stick between editor restarts until you delete the script.\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[font-variation.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31769571/font-variation.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.c